{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_004_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:140dae4c3bd6056ca1b50293936cf17cf0c900c098291d09a6a5bc628f34e100",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_22:5_01_004_22_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fef620153c32298ca58919972c58c08adf56bd92dec1c2cdddad430acc1540d2",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，这是情人节的巧克力对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_22:5_01_004_22_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37783b89f90e6018a8fb25b918642700d93182dff796fba49a63c95fb97c2a3e",
      "text": "超级开心啊，谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_22:5_01_004_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd1f356f3369c16e28e3d5de84c413b9f8a8c6662eddf96f8cb1a95131fd994b",
      "text": "总觉得一想到这是你特意为我挑的东西，就“巧”不自禁地有点害羞起来了。开玩笑的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_22:5_01_004_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1b72e4a89af94fecd9369983b7a3ada5f7c266f73bb65f73861a2bf96f32e21",
      "text": "白色情人节的回礼，你就好好期待着吧！我会准备最棒的礼物的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_22:5_01_004_22_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec57c6bca154778bde74b6f8a9437aef49fc3236ac2e35eea24d55f49eb5d229",
      "text": "那么，接下来的工作，我也会打起精神努力去干的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_22:5_01_004_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2259a95da18afca0b3c962878bb65024cb73bd55614621e8bb0556c5c4624745",
      "text": "谢谢你的情人节巧克力！ ●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_22:5_01_004_22_b:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d3063997dbbb49dba18d74a5fea742006ed964acdef9626e1c769db8cdae90e",
      "text": "这是我送给一直努力的辉先生的一点心意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_22:5_01_004_22_b:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be4289b520223cce4c6441cfc12bc7f7578639ae243ab82b7a772f0a73ec4e7b",
      "text": "不介意的话请收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_22:5_01_004_22_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3a40bdc2a95b587ad710c998a40d757e3d2b43c0d579f9fbbf575f811caae87",
      "text": "哈哈！谢啦。一想到这是你为我挑选的巧克力……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_22:5_01_004_22_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0abcb3c6774f958cc3fc33327e297099e813c153e5d2d86efd5294dd0b150bd",
      "text": "就觉得吃掉稍微有点，不，是超级舍不得啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_22:5_01_004_22_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:936e682bcee90b5e7d20800915ea0cf7c24f9f3e5b3fcc6e374130d151fcdd90",
      "text": "不过啊，要是吃了你送的巧克力，对疲惫的身体不也能期待“巧”有奇效吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_22:5_01_004_22_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e82cf174f6ce06f2ec561e128725715a33043091c20b97d2366d1106a13986be",
      "text": "因为是巧克力嘛……开玩笑的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_22:5_01_004_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f95445a0dc2cf5cf4701997401e175140bf97bc4088172ae3b62d00f93ebdcf7",
      "text": "多亏了●●●●プロデューサー，我灵光一闪想出了个好冷笑话，接下来的工作也能加把劲了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_22:5_01_004_22_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32b4ee4f6840df86f8fa2bc75c55d0d65947632bcea80e9da56bf99b580b8b39",
      "text": "你也别把自己绷得太紧，偶尔要歇口气啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_004_22:5_01_004_22_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:425f5b8aab53f9a21f220b51b38ee77975f40ef538f0e94067a5ac8db8adc392",
      "text": "这个我就心怀感激地收下享用了！好好期待下个月的回礼吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
